      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُصَايَحَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَصَايُحٌ</span></b>  signify The <i>calling</i>
or <i>crying,</i> or <i>calling out</i> or <i>crying out,</i> &amp;c., of
people, <i>one to another.</i> (S, K.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صايح</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">القَوْمُ</span> (TK) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تصايحوا</span></b>  <i>The people,</i> or <i>party,
called</i> or <i>cried,</i> &amp;c., <i>one to another.</i> (A, TK.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
